/**
 * Marco's operating SOPs, as supplied by the team.
 *
 * GENERATED, NOT HAND-WRITTEN. The source is the team's Google Doc (a bundle of
 * 19 SOPs), exported 2026-08-26. The text is verbatim apart from two
 * substitutions, both of which restore what the author wrote rather than change
 * it:
 *
 *   - Drive exports an embedded screenshot as an empty one-cell table, and 214
 *     of those across the bundle would have rendered as blank tables saying
 *     nothing. Each is replaced by a line naming what is missing, so a reader
 *     knows to open the source rather than assuming a step has no picture.
 *   - Drive escapes markdown punctuation on the way out ("\~2 min",
 *     "\*\*Field\*\*"). Those escapes are removed, so the tilde reads as a tilde
 *     and the bold renders as bold.
 *
 * WHY IT LIVES IN THE REPO. These are the documents Harvey answers from and the
 * team reads in the Knowledge Center. They are seeded by `sopImport.ts` on
 * boot, once, so a deploy carries them onto the Fly volume without anyone
 * pasting 19 documents by hand. After that first import THE KNOWLEDGE CENTER IS
 * THE SOURCE OF TRUTH — edits there are not written back here, and re-importing
 * will not overwrite them. Changing this file only affects a system that has
 * never imported before, or a deliberately bumped import version.
 */
